  m_Name: DilemmaAlgoritmoBeneficios
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::RandomEventData
  _title: Algoritmo contra fraudes
  _description: "Um sistema promete apontar quem tem mais risco de fraudar benef\xEDcios
    sociais, e a secretaria poderia investigar menos gente e gastar menos. Falta
    decidir se algu\xE9m de fora vai conferir como ele pontua cada pessoa."
  _titleEn: Anti-fraud algorithm
  _descriptionEn: A system promises to flag who is most likely to commit welfare
    fraud, so the department could investigate fewer people and spend less. It remains
    to decide whether anyone outside will check how it scores each person.
  _triggerConditions: []
  _statEffects: []
  _minTurn: 5
  _maxTurn: 16
  _choices:
  - Rule:
      Effects:
      - Parameter: 0
        Amount: -3
      - Parameter: 2
        Amount: 3
      - Parameter: 4
        Amount: 2
      FollowUpEventId: 
      FollowUpDelay: 0
    Label: Usar com auditoria independente
    LabelEn: Use it with an independent audit
    Detail: "Especialistas de fora conferem os crit\xE9rios. Sai mais caro."
    DetailEn: Outside experts check the criteria. It costs more.
  - Rule:
      Effects:
      - Parameter: 0
        Amount: 4
      FollowUpEventId: ConsequenciaAlgoritmoDiscriminacao
      FollowUpDelay: 4
    Label: Usar sem auditoria
    LabelEn: Use it without an audit
    Detail: "Economia imediata. Ningu\xE9m de fora v\xEA como cada pessoa \xE9 pontuada."
    DetailEn: Immediate savings. Nobody outside sees how each person is scored.
  - Rule:
      Effects:
      - Parameter: 0
        Amount: -2
      - Parameter: 2
        Amount: 1
      FollowUpEventId: 
      FollowUpDelay: 0
    Label: "Manter a an\xE1lise manual"
    LabelEn: Keep the manual review
    Detail: Mais lenta e cara, mas cada caso passa por uma pessoa.
    DetailEn: Slower and costlier, but every case goes through a person.
  _isFollowUpOnly: 0
  _knowledgeEntry: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 743eaf25c3271205d803c8f0027e773d, type: 2}
